{"id": "t018-028", "text": "lila said her landlord is selling up, she has to be out by end of the month. stressed doesnt cover it. she's been to 6 viewings already and lost 2 to people offering over asking. her sister Mariam said she can stay w her in walthamstow for a bit but its a sofa and a toddler. she's also got her probation review at work on the 24th. check in w her end of the wk", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "lila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "landlord", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "selling up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mariam", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "in walthamstow", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a bit"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "toddler", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "probation review", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 24th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in w her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the wk", "anchor": "a1"}]}
